ServerStorage.BrainrotModels (named Id). Hatch times stay in EggHatchTiming, river chances in CharacterCatalog.

Egg:       Id (= AuxEggTemplates name, tool attribute EggType), Rarity, Price (cash), Limited?, Luck, Characters
           Luck = multiplier on the chance of a Power roll above Ordinary (CharacterEconomy.Bands)
Character: Id (= BrainrotModels name, tool attribute CharacterId), Name (shown to players), Chance (percent of its
           egg, adds up to 100), BaseIncome ($/s at base Power; base Power = BaseIncome * 100), Move (signature
           move name), Model (source model in ServerStorage.V2Characters)
The first character of an egg is its main one: characters saved before this roster become it (CharacterCatalog
LegacyCharacters).
